    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "We can now combine both analyses that will help us answer questions like the following:\n",
        "Do college towns complain about different things?\n",
        "Are certain topics more negative in specific areas?"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "L9sbqKYpLHIp"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#COMBINING BOTH ANALYSES\n",
        "combined_insight = df_lda.groupby(\n",
        "    ['Is_College_Town', 'Sentiment', 'Dominant_Topic']\n",
        ").size()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"--- LOCATION + SENTIMENT + TOPIC ---\")\n",
        "print(combined_insight)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YD97Ov7uK9FI",
        "colab": {
